# Day 40 — Unprotected Admin Functionality

## Topic

OWASP A01 — Broken Access Control

### Lab
PortSwigger Web Security Academy — Unprotected admin functionality with unpredictable URL

---

## Objective

Investigate whether an application's administrative functionality is properly protected by server-side authorization controls.

The lab contains an admin panel at an unpredictable URL.

The location of the admin panel is disclosed somewhere in the application's source code.

---

## Reconnaissance

The application's homepage source was inspected using Firefox.

The following JavaScript was identified:

```javascript
var isAdmin = false;

if (isAdmin) {
    var topLinksTag =
    document.getElementsByClassName("top-links")[0];

    var adminPanelTag = document.createElement('a');

    adminPanelTag.setAttribute('href', '/admin-rblf21');

    adminPanelTag.innerText = 'Admin panel';

    topLinksTag.append(adminPanelTag);
}